full-query: "As a DevOps engineer, you use a CloudFormation stack to maintain an Auto Scaling group and a launch template. When there is an update in the launch template, you would update the stack with the new CloudFormation template. You need to ensure that the CloudFormation stack creates a new Auto Scaling group during the update and deletes the old Auto Scaling group during the cleanup process. Which of the following UpdatePolicy attributes would you configure in the CloudFormation template?"
